The goal was to understand the complete lifecycle of a security event:

Attack
  ↓
Endpoint Activity
  ↓
Windows Security Event
  ↓
Log Collection
  ↓
SIEM Analysis
  ↓
Detection Rule
  ↓
Security Alert

The lab demonstrates how offensive security testing can be combined with defensive monitoring to validate whether a security monitoring environment is capable of detecting credential attacks.

